{"id":"beeed89974e85c6b","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_WorldVal.md","title":"WorldVal","display":"WorldVal","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"WorldVal","parameters":["w","v"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"WorldVal"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>w</span><span>v</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：正规模态。有序参数：<code>w</code>、<code>v</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ WorldVal w v)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists omega (exists pw (and (@ Omega omega) (and (@ Power w pw) (@ Map v omega pw)))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b242e5082334b5f2\" href=\"?note=b242e5082334b5f2\" title=\"ZFC_Map\">Map</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d77373a330f372f\" href=\"?note=5d77373a330f372f\" title=\"ZFC_Power\">Power</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ WorldVal w v)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Map","status":"resolved","id":"b242e5082334b5f2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Map|Map]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_Power|Power]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Omega","status":"resolved","id":"3bcf6cd1d43a3007","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Map|Map]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_Power|Power]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Power","status":"resolved","id":"5d77373a330f372f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Map|Map]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_Power|Power]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":814,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a9a6ec6fb6ca2f8","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_Reflexive|Reflexive]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_Transitive|Transitive]]；[[ZFC_Upset|Upset]]；[[ZFC_WorldVal|WorldVal]]"},{"id":"4911f5764eb9236a","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_DirectedCones|DirectedCones]]；[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_Reflexive|Reflexive]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_Transitive|Transitive]]；[[ZFC_Upset|Upset]]；[[ZFC_WorldVal|WorldVal]]"},{"id":"e9170a8afc11bfb4","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_ConnectedCones|ConnectedCones]]；[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_Reflexive|Reflexive]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_Transitive|Transitive]]；[[ZFC_Upset|Upset]]；[[ZFC_WorldV